{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with a unique mechanic and theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tutorial</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the starting area, which contains toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/tutorial.gif?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/regions.gif?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Offsets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/offsets.png?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toros</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters in Toroban are called Toros. There can be multiple Toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles. The same colored Toros strongly stick together. Multiple Toros pushing together are stronger and can push more objects at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/toros.png?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desert</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the mechanics combine together in this area.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1961850?t=1743487877","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1961850?t=1743487877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743487877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743487877","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with a unique mechanic and theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tutorial</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the starting area, which contains toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/tutorial.gif?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Regions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/regions.gif?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Offsets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/offsets.png?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toros</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The characters in Toroban are called Toros. There can be multiple Toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles. The same colored Toros strongly stick together. Multiple Toros pushing together are stronger and can push more objects at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/extras/toros.png?t=1743487877\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Desert</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of the mechanics combine together in this area.</p>","developers":["Hebert Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/header.jpg?t=1743487877","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM, 0.5 TFLOPS (FP32)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM, 4 TFLOPS (FP32)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","r